  "description": "It had been a long time, but Hae-in was still having nightmares.\n\n\"Apologize to me now, and I won't touch Jung Tae-hyuk.\"\n\n\"If you want an apology so badly, then try to seduce him.\"\n\nJung Tae-hyuk was the only thing his stepbrother didn't have. If only he could have him, there was no more perfect revenge.\n\n\"How are you going to seduce me with such a scared face?\" I asked, unaware of the consequences of this bet.\n\n\"I'm sorry, sir.\"\n\n\"Why didn't I feel like shit when you were being so flirtatious?\"\n\nThe blatant stare stopped at Tae-hyuk's feet.\n\n\"Is it because you're just standing here looking at Yoon?\"\n\nWas it wrong to drag him into something that had nothing to do with him because of feelings that were over a decade old?\n\n\"You're not worth using anymore, did you get tired of being stuck with me?\"\n\n\"We're not in love, it's just physical.\"\n\n\"Don't even think about running away.\"\n\nShe has to end the relationship to protect Tae-hyuk's child.\n\n\"Love or not... Hold on. Until you get tired of me and want to throw me away.\"\n\nI feel like I'll never be able to get away from him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8876261)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8876252)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003318)",
